          "anchor" : "discussion",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Discussion",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The object ID defines the main identity of an object within a design.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "One object can share multiple snapshots, which are identified by their",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/ObjectSnapshot\/snapshotID",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : ".",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Objects within a ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/Plane",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " have unique ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/TransientObject\/objectID",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : ", however there",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "might be multiple snapshots with the same ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/TransientObject\/objectID",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " within the design.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The ID is generated using internal identity manager and is",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "guaranteed to be unique within the design. If an object is coming from",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "a foreign interface or from a storage, an explicit ID might be",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "requested, however the programmer is responsible for checking its",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "uniqueness within given context.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
